    feat(gallery): app-wide generated-image feed — /api/gallery/images
    
    Every image the app ever generated (Test Studio cells, canvas previews,
    comparison runs, improve results), newest first, cursor-paginated so a
    render landing mid-scroll can never duplicate or skip a page. Filters
    (dataset, renders/improved, liked) narrow the count with the page; the
    dataset list stays unfiltered because it feeds the picker.
    
    Same rows, same serializer as the checkpoint/run galleries.
